# Density Compare
# Hydrogen (H) — real density 9e-05 g/cm³. equal masses: Hydrogen vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Hydrogen Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 445.8mm color: #88ff88 at (-20mm, 222.9mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 0.0 g — the water cube is the reference
